      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While Vitamin C is an antioxidant, taking very high doses for detoxification can sometimes stress the kidneys, which is a concern for kidney stone sufferers. For calcium oxalate stones, hydration, diet, and sometimes citrate supplements are medically recommended approaches for prevention. It is crucial to discuss any significant supplement changes, especially high-dose Vitamin C, with your nephrologist first.",
      "source": "target",
