      "role": "user",
      "content": "i understand what you're saying about oxalate, but i feel like i can manage that myself. i'm already drinking plenty of water. if i just take it morning and night, shouldn't that spread it out enough so it's not an issue? i really just want a definitive answer on whether 2500mg is safe for me to start tomorrow. if i'm careful with my diet, wouldn't the high dose be fine? i'm looking for something more concrete than just \"go see another doctor.\"",
